* demo subcircuits for the typeCAD/pcb spice simulation demo
* two 1k resistors in parallel = 500 ohm between A and B
.subckt RPAR A B
R1 A B 1k
R2 A B 1k
.ends RPAR

* asymmetric ladder: A -1k- B -2k- C
* (used to show simulation.pinOrder mapping component pins onto subckt ports)
.subckt RLAG A B C
R1 A B 1k
R2 B C 2k
.ends RLAG
